{"vid":"q4JyFF46528","source":"q4JyFF46528.en-GB.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.2,"txt":"Hi, Phil. How are you doing?"},{"t":2,"txt":"I'm good, I'm good. A little bit tired, but yeah."},{"t":4.5,"txt":"I'm good."},{"t":5.3,"txt":"Oh no. Why?"},{"t":6.5,"txt":"Lots of housework this weekend."},{"t":7.8,"txt":"We had to get the house ready so, yeah, a lot to do."},{"t":10.9,"txt":"You said ready?"},{"t":11.9,"txt":"Ready for what?"},{"t":13,"txt":"Oh, we've got some people coming to visit, so we had to..."},{"t":15.4,"txt":"we had to get ready for that."},{"t":16.8,"txt":"Well, Phil, we are talking about housework today in Real Easy English."},{"t":21.5,"txt":"So, housework is all of those jobs you do in the house."},{"t":25,"txt":"So, cleaning, washing, cooking – things like that."},{"t":28.9,"txt":"Yep. All really important things."},{"t":31.3,"txt":"Just before we start, I just wanted to remind everyone that they can go"},{"t":37.2,"txt":"to our website to get a worksheet to get even more practice,"},{"t":41,"txt":"and that is bbclearningenglish.com."},{"t":50,"txt":"So, Phil, you said at the weekend you did a lot of housework."},{"t":54.4,"txt":"What did you do?"},{"t":55.6,"txt":"Well, I mean we share out the housework, but I was..."},{"t":59.7,"txt":"I had to make sure I was cleaning the kitchen."},{"t":63.2,"txt":"I also did..."},{"t":64.8,"txt":"We say do the hoovering or do the vacuuming,"},{"t":68.1,"txt":"around all the carpets to make sure that's nice and clean,"},{"t":70.5,"txt":"under all the furniture."},{"t":72.1,"txt":"So, Georgie, do you do a lot of housework?"},{"t":75.1,"txt":"Well, I live in a shared flat,"},{"t":77.8,"txt":"so I have two housemates who are not super clean,"},{"t":83.1,"txt":"so I have a bit of a routine with them. Every weekend,"},{"t":87.4,"txt":"one person will clean the communal areas."},{"t":91.3,"txt":"So, those are the areas that are shared – so the kitchen and the living room."},{"t":96.6,"txt":"One person will clean those properly."},{"t":98.8,"txt":"So, wipe the surfaces, wipe away the crumbs."},{"t":102.5,"txt":"So, the crumbs are little bits of food."},{"t":104.6,"txt":"Then hoover or sweep the floor."},{"t":107.3,"txt":"So, that removes the crumbs from the floor"},{"t":109.5,"txt":"so that the floor is ready to be mopped."},{"t":112.2,"txt":"So, when you mop, that's when you make the floor wet and properly clean."},{"t":116.6,"txt":"That's a really impressive system."},{"t":119.3,"txt":"I like the way you've got it so organised."},{"t":121.1,"txt":"We always find we run out of time to get a lot of housework done,"},{"t":124.6,"txt":"or we're doing stuff at the weekend or we're working during the week,"},{"t":128,"txt":"and so some of those jobs, they get put off and put off"},{"t":131.2,"txt":"and put off, which isn't good."},{"t":133.1,"txt":"But yeah, it happens sometimes."},{"t":135.8,"txt":"Well, there's also just so many other things we would rather be doing."},{"t":139.7,"txt":"So, yeah, it's easy to put off – to delay."},{"t":143.4,"txt":"Georgie, we're talking about household chores."},{"t":146.6,"txt":"Is there one that you really hate doing?"},{"t":150.4,"txt":"Yes, Phil, there is one job that comes to mind immediately,"},{"t":154.3,"txt":"which is cleaning the bathroom."},{"t":156.3,"txt":"Specifically cleaning the toilet."},{"t":158.6,"txt":"Oh yes."},{"t":159.3,"txt":"Not very nice!"},{"t":160.2,"txt":"Yeah. No, not at all."},{"t":162,"txt":"Do you have one that you hate the most?"},{"t":164.2,"txt":"I think what I really dislike is trying to clean things – the bits"},{"t":169.8,"txt":"on the cooker where everything gets stuck on,"},{"t":172.6,"txt":"and you have to really rub it and scrub it really hard."},{"t":177.4,"txt":"I hate those jobs."},{"t":178.5,"txt":"So, do you..."},{"t":179.8,"txt":"You said that you share..."},{"t":180.9,"txt":"you share the chores."},{"t":182.8,"txt":"Do you get your kids to do chores?"},{"t":185.4,"txt":"Now, that's a really good question."},{"t":186.9,"txt":"We ask the kids to do chores and sometimes they do something."},{"t":194,"txt":"OK."},{"t":194.7,"txt":"But not a lot."},{"t":195.8,"txt":"I'd really like them to be able to keep their rooms tidy."},{"t":199.8,"txt":"That's never going to happen,"},{"t":201.3,"txt":"it feels."},{"t":203,"txt":"I'd really like it if they could, you know, help out cleaning the living room"},{"t":206.7,"txt":"and putting things away."},{"t":207.8,"txt":"But, yeah, we haven't taught them very well."},{"t":210.4,"txt":"Oh, maybe one day!"},{"t":212.2,"txt":"Maybe."},{"t":212.8,"txt":"It's when you become an adult,"},{"t":214.2,"txt":"I think, that you really appreciate a clean space,"},{"t":217.1,"txt":"so hopefully that will come."},{"t":218.9,"txt":"I was terrible as a teenager."},{"t":220.7,"txt":"I didn't do much as a teenager at all, so this is just coming back to me now."},{"t":226.9,"txt":"Yeah. Well, me too!"},{"t":228.2,"txt":"So, we've talked about chores that we hate doing,"},{"t":231.8,"txt":"but are there any jobs that you enjoy doing?"},{"t":235.8,"txt":"Well, you know what?"},{"t":237.4,"txt":"Laundry or washing – that's washing your clothes."},{"t":240.8,"txt":"That can sometimes be really satisfying when you get a lot of it done."},{"t":245.2,"txt":"And actually, I've just got a new washing machine and it's much bigger"},{"t":249.3,"txt":"than the one I had before, so I can do so much in one load."},{"t":253.7,"txt":"Phil, that is so exciting."},{"t":255.8,"txt":"Even better – because it's summer at the moment,"},{"t":258.4,"txt":"I can get it dry so quick."},{"t":260.5,"txt":"It's amazing!"},{"t":261.8,"txt":"I love that!"},{"t":262.9,"txt":"Putting a... putting a load of washing in the..."},{"t":266.1,"txt":"in the washing machine and then having it dry by the end of the day."},{"t":269.6,"txt":"That is so good."},{"t":270.7,"txt":"It's the best thing."},{"t":272.7,"txt":"Teenage Georgie would be so disappointed that I'm excited by laundry,"},{"t":276.6,"txt":"but here we go...!"},{"t":283.1,"txt":"OK. Phil, let's recap the vocabulary we used in this conversation,"},{"t":287.4,"txt":"starting with 'housework'."},{"t":288.8,"txt":"So, this is the general term for jobs that we have to do in the house."},{"t":294.1,"txt":"And then we had 'chores', which are the specific jobs that you have to do –"},{"t":298,"txt":"for example, laundry."},{"t":299.8,"txt":"Yes. So, 'laundry' is washing your clothes."},{"t":303.2,"txt":"We say 'do the laundry', or just 'do the washing'."},{"t":306.9,"txt":"Yes. And we had some other chores – for example,"},{"t":309.6,"txt":"hoovering and sweeping the floor,"},{"t":312.1,"txt":"which is what you do when there are crumbs on the floor."},{"t":315.4,"txt":"After you've swept the crumbs, you can mop the floor,"},{"t":319.6,"txt":"which is when you make the floor wet and clean it like that."},{"t":323.3,"txt":"Yes. We also talked about jobs that you hate,"},{"t":326.4,"txt":"and sometimes when you really hate a job, you end up putting it off –"},{"t":332.5,"txt":"that means to delay it."},{"t":334,"txt":"If you 'put something off', you delay something,"},{"t":336.4,"txt":"sometimes because you just don't want to do it."},{"t":339,"txt":"So, that is the end of this episode of Real Easy English,"},{"t":342.7,"txt":"but we'll be back next week, won't we?"},{"t":344.9,"txt":"Yes, we'll be back with another episode."},{"t":347.2,"txt":"Also, don't forget about that worksheet"},{"t":349.6,"txt":"that's on our website, bbclearningenglish.com."},{"t":353,"txt":"Goodbye for now."},{"t":354.4,"txt":"Bye!"}],"words":[{"t":0.16,"w":"Hi,"},{"t":0.16,"w":"Phil."},{"t":0.16,"w":"How"},{"t":0.16,"w":"are"},{"t":0.16,"w":"you"},{"t":0.16,"w":"doing?"},{"t":1.96,"w":"I'm"},{"t":1.96,"w":"good,"},{"t":1.96,"w":"I'm"},{"t":1.96,"w":"good."},{"t":1.96,"w":"A"},{"t":1.96,"w":"little"},{"t":1.96,"w":"bit"},{"t":1.96,"w":"tired,"},{"t":1.96,"w":"but"},{"t":1.96,"w":"yeah."},{"t":4.48,"w":"I'm"},{"t":